{"title":"*My Dreadful Body*","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/970096949/0/marginalrevolution~My-Dreadful-Body.html","date":1790330901000,"content":"<p>By Egana Djabbarova of Azerbaijan.  A wonderful short novel, and as described by Olga Grjasnowa “An extraordinary novel that translates corporality and estrangement into language.”  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/My-Dreadful-Body-Egana-Djabbarova/dp/1954404417/ref=sr_1_1?crid=PJE6H06U3XJS&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.tZq-uVd0WwW6c1Uin7XuwNQxskBJddFEdjiOnA0YBdNt2SPBz2EkkjHF46SHLIkAzIv-E_GELF4VudIZlPCKObgiGbPh9TEih17cR9TuuQw.UrusHBkBnYSv5OofbCbZAyBBgR6e7xcAW5P9EenAfBQ&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=my+dreadful+body&amp;qid=1790280516&amp;sprefix=my+dreadful+body%2Caps%2C319&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">the Amazon link</a>.</p>\r\n<p>This has been a fantastic year for fiction, and in November I will be writing up a report.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/my-dreadful-body.html\">*My Dreadful Body*</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/970096949/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/970096949/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/970096949/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/970096949/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/970096949/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <